== Notes ==
*At the end of the dungeon run, all '''Revive Stones''' disappear.

== Bugs ==
* A '''Revive Stone''' can be transferred from a {{Gamemode|Bingo}} profile. However, it will show up as an "Unknown Item" and cannot be claimed.
